---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="AI" description="I'll show you how to use AI — and build the first prototype. In weeks.">
  <section class="hero-small">
    <span class="tenet-label">Core Tenet</span>
    <h1>"We know we should use AI but <span class="highlight">don't know how</span>"</h1>
    <p class="hero-answer">I'll show you — and build the first prototype. In weeks.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="problem-text">
      <p>
        Everyone's talking about AI. Your board wants an "AI strategy." 
        Your competitors claim to be "AI-native." And you're stuck wondering where to even start.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most AI initiatives fail because they start with technology instead of problems. 
        I start with your actual business challenges, then figure out what AI can realistically solve.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">How I Help</h2>
    <div class="approach">
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Identify Real Opportunities</h3>
        <p>Not everything needs AI. I find the 20% of use cases that will deliver 80% of the value — and tell you honestly when AI isn't the answer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Build Working Prototypes</h3>
        <p>I don't just advise. I work with AI agents as my construction crew, shipping working prototypes in weeks — not consultancy timelines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-item">
        <h3>Transfer Knowledge</h3>
        <p>The goal isn't to make you dependent on me. It's to help your team understand what's possible and how to think about AI pragmatically.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Track Record</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">12</span>
        <span class="stat-label">AI products shipped in 4 months</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-number">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">weeks average prototype time</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Work</h2>
    <div class="related-work">
      <a href="/work#the-stack" class="work-link">
        <span class="work-title">The Stack</span>
        <span class="work-desc">AI-synthesised investigative journalism</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/work#slice-os" class="work-link">
        <span class="work-title">Slice OS</span>
        <span class="work-desc">Pizza truck operations platform</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/work#zeitgeist" class="work-link">
        <span class="work-title">Zeitgeist</span>
        <span class="work-desc">Real-time cultural intelligence</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- From the River -->
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">From the River</h2>
    <p class="river-intro">Podcast episodes and articles on this topic:</p>
    <div class="river-items">
      <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/10x-your-ai-results-with-this-ultimate-context-engineering/id1770010162" target="_blank" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">🎙️</span>
        <div>
          <strong>10x your AI results with context engineering</strong>
          <span>The single most important skill for getting great output</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/does-ai-work/id1770010162?i=1000728592863" target="_blank" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">🎙️</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Does AI work?</strong>
          <span>OpenAI's research on LLMs in organisations — tested</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/im-working-on-the-zeitgeist/id1770010162?i=1000724729646" target="_blank" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">🎙️</span>
        <div>
          <strong>I'm working on the Zeitgeist</strong>
          <span>Building a business intelligence platform with AI</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/insights" class="river-link">
        <span class="river-icon">📝</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Chain of thought prompting</strong>
          <span>The technique that changed everything</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <a href="/insights" class="river-more">See all AI content in The River →</a>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Ready to build something?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-small {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .tenet-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .hero-small h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .hero-answer {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .problem-text p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .approach {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .approach-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: #111;
  }
  
  .approach-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .approach-item p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  
  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .related-work {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .work-link {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #111;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .work-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .work-title {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  
  .work-desc {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .river-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .river-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .river-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: #111;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .river-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    background: #0f0f0f;
  }
  
  .river-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .river-link div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .river-link strong {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
  }
  
  .river-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .river-more {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  .river-more:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
